00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:06,000
This is a list of television films produced for the cable networks
Hallmark Channel (HC) and Hallmark Mystery (HMM).

12
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Such films are currently called Hallmark Channel
Original Movies and Hallmark Mysteries.

13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
The Hallmark Channel was officially launched in August 2001, with its sister channel Hallmark
Movies & Mysteries (originally Hallmark Movie Channel) launched in January 2004.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
In addition to stand-alone original films, both channels broadcast a number of original film series, including Garage Sale Mysteries, Jesse
Stone, Signed, Sealed, Delivered, Aurora Teagarden Mysteries and The Good Witch, as well having produced mystery-themed wheel series.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Hallmark Channel achieved its highest-ever broadcast premiere ratings with the 2014 original movie
Christmas Under Wraps, starring Candace Cameron Bure, which was watched by 5.8 million viewers.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
Both networks receive their highest ratings during their "Countdown to Christmas" period, with a
succession of festive original films being broadcast from late October to late December.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
A number of these films are also carried in Canada by the W Network and Citytv under content distribution agreements with Hallmark parent
Crown Media; the vast majority of Hallmark Channel films are filmed in Canada and thus qualify for Canadian content quotas.

18
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
In the United Kingdom, Hallmark Original Movies are
shown on Movies 24, a sister channel.

